           DRIN: suggests that special handling is currently limited
           to longworms (you have to be attacking the head),
           headless monsters, green slime, monsters wearing helmets,
           mindless monsters, monsters that cause stoning, and
           monsters that violate food conducts.  I don't know
           exactly what the original bug report intended, but
           possible additional candidates for special handling that
           I can think of include poisonous and acidic monsters,
           both kinds of mind flayers, bats, domestic dogs and cats,
           your own starting race, anything with no solid form, and
           perhaps some things should (sometimes) grant intrinsics
           even if you only eat the brain (e.g., tengu).
